<title>USA: Ford Jan. U.S. car sales off, truck sales up.</title>
<headline>Ford Jan. U.S. car sales off, truck sales up.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Jan 1-31, 1997     Jan 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   113,936	   123,997	     -8.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 161,416	   142,079	    +13.6</p>
<p> Import Car		 1,859	     3,503	    -46.9</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26 in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
